@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.1765 = private unnamed_addr constant [500 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for the presence of prohibited trailing commas.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0ATrailing commas are not essential in some cases and can therefore be viewed\0Aas unnecessary.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afoo = (1, 2, 3,)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afoo = (1, 2, 3)\0A```\0A\0A## Formatter compatibility\0AWe recommend against using this rule alongside the [formatter]. The\0Aformatter enforces consistent use of trailing commas, making the rule redundant.\0A\0A[formatter]:https://docs.astral.sh/ruff/formatter/\0A", align 1
