@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.1858 = private unnamed_addr constant [541 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for the presence of unused private `typing.TypedDict` definitions.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AA private `typing.TypedDict` that is defined but not used is likely a\0Amistake. It should either be used, made public, or removed to avoid\0Aconfusion.\0A\0A## Example\0A\0A```pyi\0Aimport typing\0A\0Aclass _UnusedPrivateTypedDict(typing.TypedDict):\0A    foo: list[int]\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A\0A```pyi\0Aimport typing\0A\0Aclass _UsedPrivateTypedDict(typing.TypedDict):\0A    foo: set[str]\0A\0Adef func(arg: _UsedPrivateTypedDict) -> _UsedPrivateTypedDict: ...\0A```\0A", align 1
