@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.2043 = private unnamed_addr constant [433 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for repeated keyword arguments in function calls.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0APython does not allow repeated keyword arguments in function calls. If a\0Afunction is called with the same keyword argument multiple times, the\0Ainterpreter will raise an exception.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afunc(1, 2, c=3, **{\22c\22: 4})\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [Python documentation: Argument](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-argument)\0A", align 1
